            0.8403361344537815,
            0.3579072532699168
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For his synthesis of analytic number theory, homogeneous dynamics, topology, and representation theory, which has resolved long-standing problems in areas such as the equidistribution of arithmetic objects."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.5042016806722689,
